Z||000012||Archie||12-09-2001||09:03 AM||||Hey LZeitgeist, check out the part number on the side of the box that you got from me. Then ask those other guys what part number is on their $250 (wholesale price) clutch. Then you can go the the CForce web site <A HREF="http://www.centerforce.com/" TARGET=_blank>http://www.centerforce.com/</A>   and you'll find that the Clutch they make for me isn't even available to the general public yet. So there is actually no comparison between what they are talking about and what you have.<P>Later <P>Archie<P>------------------<BR>Just how fast do you want to go?||||reg||1
